const TEXTS = {"PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoChoosePlayer":"{RIVAL}: Heh, I don't need to be\\ngreedy like you. I'm mature!\\pGo ahead and choose, {PLAYER}!$","Route3_Text_ColtonDefeat":"You beat me again!$","Text_PlayerIsPlayingRightNowGoForIt":"It appears as if {STR_VAR_1} is playing\\nright now.\\lGo for it!$","ViridianForest_Text_RickIntro":"Hey! You have POKéMON!\\nCome on!\\lLet's battle 'em!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_NotFamiliarWithYouYet":"It's not quite familiar with you\\nyet.\\pPOKéMON are all quite wary when\\nyou first get them.$","PewterCity_Text_OhPlayer":"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$","Aide_Text_GetEnoughMonsComeBackForItem":"…Oh. I see.\\pWhen you get {STR_VAR_1} kinds of POKéMON,\\ncome back for the {STR_VAR_2}.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_AllBoysLeaveOakLookingForYou":"MOM: …Right.\\nAll boys leave home someday.\\lIt said so on TV.\\pOh, yes. PROF. OAK, next door, was\\nlooking for you.$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyPostBattle":"Sometimes, you can find stuff on\\nthe ground.\\pI'm looking for the stuff I\\ndropped. Can you help me?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_CouldntLoveYouMore":"It couldn't possibly love you\\nany more than it does now.\\pYour POKéMON is happy beyond\\nwords.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_SayHiToOakForMe":"Okay, thanks! Please say hi to\\nPROF. OAK for me, too.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LookingNiceInNoTime":"DAISY: Okay, I'll get it looking\\nnice in no time.$","PalletTown_Text_PressStartToOpenMenuCopy":"TRAINER TIPS!\\pPress START to open the MENU!$","PewterCity_Text_ClefairyCameFromMoon":"CLEFAIRY came from the moon.\\nThat's what the rumor is.\\pThey appeared after MOON STONES\\nfell on MT. MOON.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_AllMonTypesHaveStrongAndWeakPoints":"All POKéMON types have strong and\\nweak points against others.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_BlankEncyclopedia":"It's like an encyclopedia, but the\\npages are blank.$","ViridianCity_Text_WatchThatToLearnBasics":"If there's something you don't\\nunderstand, watch that.\\pIt will teach you about the basics\\nof being a POKéMON TRAINER.$","CableClub_Text_SomeoneIsNotReadyToLink":"Someone is not ready to link.\\pPlease come back after everyone\\nhas made preparations.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingBulbasaur":"I see! BULBASAUR is your choice.\\nIt's very easy to raise.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you want to go with\\nthe GRASS POKéMON BULBASAUR?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFirstPage":"Let's check out the notebook.\\pFirst page…\\pPOKé BALLS are used to catch\\nPOKéMON.\\pUp to six POKéMON can be carried\\nin your party.\\pPeople who raise and battle\\nwith POKéMON are called TRAINERS.$","Route3_Text_GregRematchIntro":"You're a TRAINER, aren't you?\\nLet's get with it right away!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainFreeze":"A frozen POKéMON becomes\\nhelplessly immobile.\\pIt stays frozen even after the\\nbattle ends.\\pUse ICE HEAL to thaw out the\\nsuffering POKéMON.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakWhichOneWillYouChoose":"OAK: Now, {PLAYER}.\\pInside those three POKé BALLS are\\nPOKéMON.\\pWhich one will you choose for\\nyourself?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveSomethingForMe":"OAK: Oh, {PLAYER}!\\nHow is my old POKéMON?\\pWell, it seems to be growing more\\nattached to you.\\pYou must be talented as a POKéMON\\nTRAINER.\\pWhat's that?\\nYou have something for me?$","CableClub_Text_NeedFourPlayers":"There must be four players to play\\nthis Battle Mode.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_BlackboardListsStatusProblems":"The blackboard lists POKéMON\\nSTATUS problems during battles.$","Text_Burglary":"There are obvious signs of burglary\\nhere…$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerIntro":"The sea cleanses my body and soul!$","ViridianForest_Text_UseAntidoteForPoison":"For poison, use ANTIDOTE!\\nGet it at POKéMON MARTS!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DoYouKnowWhatAmberIs":"You can't sneak in the back way!\\nNice try, kid, but no.\\pOh, whatever!\\nDo you know what AMBER is?$","Text_DreamEaterTeach":"Yawn!\\nI must have dozed off in the sun.\\pI had this weird dream about\\na DROWZEE eating my dream.\\pAnd…\\nI learned how to eat dreams…\\pOogh, this is too spooky!\\pLet me teach it to a POKéMON so\\nI can forget about it!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiIntro":"Rrrroar!\\nI'm working myself into a rage!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice":"Yo!\\nChamp in the making!\\pEven I don't know the VIRIDIAN\\nLEADER's identity.\\pBut one thing's certain.\\nThis will be the toughest of all\\lthe GYM LEADERS.\\pAlso, I heard that the TRAINERS\\nhere like GROUND-type POKéMON.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiIntro":"Heh!\\nYou must be running out of steam\\lby now!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniPostBattle":"Having lost in this fashion, \\nI can't face my followers.\\lI have betrayed their trust.\\pAs of today, TEAM ROCKET is\\nfinished forever!\\pAs for myself, I shall dedicate\\nmy life to training again.\\pLet us meet again someday!\\nFarewell!$","Text_DishesPlatesNeatlyLinedUp":"Dishes and plates are neatly\\nlined up.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiDefeat":"Wargh!$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalPostBattle":"I heard the POKéMON LEAGUE is\\ncrawling with tough TRAINERS.\\pI have to figure out how to get\\npast them.\\pYou should quit dawdling and get a\\nmove on!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsGoingToHaveRadioShow":"PROF. OAK is going to have his own\\nradio show soon.\\pThe program will be called PROF.\\nOAK's POKéMON SEMINAR.$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradingPikachuWithKid":"I'm trading POKéMON with that kid\\nthere.\\pI had two PIKACHU, so I figured\\nI might as well trade one.$","PokedexRating_Text_NationalDexSeenXOwnedY":"And your NATIONAL POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenIntro":"The truly talented win with style.$","Route21_North_Text_IanRematchIntro":"IAN: My sis is still a slob.\\nHelp me get her into shape!$","PewterCity_Text_SprayingRepelToKeepWildMonsOut":"I'm spraying REPEL to keep wild\\nPOKéMON out of my garden!$","PewterCity_Mart_Text_BoughtWeirdFishFromShadyGuy":"A shady old guy sucked me into\\nbuying this weird fish POKéMON!\\pIt's totally weak and it cost ¥500!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ErrandForGrandpaThisWillHelp":"Grandpa asked you to run an\\nerrand?\\pGee, that's lazy of him.\\nHere, this will help you.$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeaderOfTwo":"Please decide which of you two\\nwill become the LEADER.\\pThe other player must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLetsCheckOutMons":"{RIVAL}: Wait, {PLAYER}!\\nLet's check out our POKéMON!\\pCome on, I'll take you on!$","Text_TellMeWhatsYourProfile":"Tell me something good about\\nyourself. What's your profile?$","PewterCity_Text_RunningShoesLetterFromMom":"There's a letter attached…\\pDear {PLAYER},\\pHere is a pair of RUNNING SHOES\\nfor my beloved challenger.\\pRemember, I'll always cheer for\\nyou! Don't ever give up!\\pFrom Mom$","Text_Painting":"It's a pretty picture of a POKéMON.\\nIt looks like it's feeling good.$","Route3_Text_SallyDefeat":"Be nice!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMustReallyWorkToFillPokedex":"Now, {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}!\\pThis time, you really must work\\ntowards filling your POKéDEXES.\\pI urge you to make them the best\\nand the most complete of all time!\\pTruly, this is a monumentally great\\nundertaking in POKéMON history!$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeWhichDirectCornerRoom":"Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nyour friends here.\\pWhich room would you like to\\nenter?$","Route3_Text_GregIntro":"Are you a TRAINER?\\nLet's get with it right away!$","ViridianCity_Text_ExplainCaterpieWeedle":"CATERPIE has no poison,\\nbut WEEDLE does.\\pWatch that your POKéMON aren't\\nstabbed by WEEDLE's POISON STING.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamIntro":"Stop right there, kid!\\pYou're ten thousand light-years \\nfrom facing BROCK!$","Text_AccessedProfOaksPC":"Accessed PROF. OAK's PC…\\pAccessed the POKéDEX Rating\\nSystem…$","PewterCity_Text_TrainerTipsEarningEXP":"TRAINER TIPS\\pAll POKéMON that appear in battle,\\nhowever briefly, earn EXP Points.$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradingMyClefairyForPikachu":"I really want a PIKACHU, so I'm\\ntrading my CLEFAIRY for one.$","Text_WhatAreYouLikeNow":"What are you like now?\\nI'd really like to know.$","ViridianForest_Text_WeakenMonsBeforeCapture":"TRAINER TIPS\\pWeaken POKéMON before attempting\\ncapture!\\pWhen healthy, they may escape!$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyIntro":"I might be little, but I won't like\\nit if you go easy on me!$","PewterCity_Text_BrocksLookingForChallengersFollowMe":"You're a TRAINER, right?\\pBROCK's looking for new\\nchallengers. Follow me!$","Text_HavePokedexRated":"Would you like to have your\\nPOKéDEX rated?$","Text_RivalVictory":"{RIVAL}: Yeah!\\nAm I great or what?$","Text_BootedUpPC":"{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBePatientRival":"OAK: Be patient, {RIVAL}.\\nYou can have one, too!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM39FromBrock":"{PLAYER} received TM39\\nfrom BROCK.$","ViridianForest_Text_RickDefeat":"No!\\nCATERPIE can't hack it!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedMonFromOak":"{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_1}\\nfrom PROF. OAK!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakFavorToAskYouPlayer":"Ah, now this is excellent!\\p{PLAYER}, I have another important\\nfavor to ask of you.\\pI need you to listen closely.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBattleMonForItToGrow":"OAK: {PLAYER}, raise your young\\nPOKéMON by making it battle.\\pIt has to battle for it to grow.$","Route3_Text_JaniceIntro":"Excuse me!\\nYou looked at me, didn't you?$","PewterCity_House1_Text_NidoranSit":"NIDORAN, sit!$","Text_LikeProfileWayItIs":"Okay, you like your profile the\\nway it is.\\pI think so, too.$","Text_PutItemAway":"{PLAYER} put the {STR_VAR_2}\\nin the {STR_VAR_3}.$","Route21_North_Text_WadeIntro":"I got a big haul!\\nWanna go for it?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalNoFairWhatAboutMe":"{RIVAL}: Hey! Gramps! No fair!\\nWhat about me?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveRequestForYouTwo":"OAK: Oh, right!\\nI have a request for you two.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_HeardYouBattledRival":"DAISY: {PLAYER}, I heard you had\\na battle against {RIVAL}.\\pI wish I'd seen that!$","PalletTown_Text_OhLookLook":"Oh!\\nLook, look!$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_ManyMonsOnlyInForests":"Many POKéMON live only in forests \\nand caves.\\pYou need to be persistent and look\\neverywhere to get different kinds.$","Route22_Text_LateRivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: What? {PLAYER}!\\nWhat a surprise to see you here!\\pSo you're going to the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE?\\pYou collected all the BADGES, too?\\nThat's cool!\\pThen I'll whip you, {PLAYER}, as a\\nwarm-up for the POKéMON LEAGUE!\\pCome on!$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsForUnionRoom":"To enter the UNION ROOM, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.$","Route23_Text_VictoryRoadGateSign":"VICTORY ROAD GATE -\\nPOKéMON LEAGUE$","PewterCity_Mart_Text_GoodThingsIfRaiseMonsDiligently":"Good things can happen if you raise\\nPOKéMON diligently.\\pEven the weak ones can surprise\\nyou if you don't give up on them.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontLikeWayItGlaresAtYou":"{PLAYER}, I don't like the way it\\nglares at you.\\pCould you try being a little nicer\\nto it?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalDefeat":"WHAT?\\nUnbelievable!\\lI picked the wrong POKéMON!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakPokedexOnDesk":"On the desk there is my invention,\\nthe POKéDEX!\\pIt automatically records data on\\nPOKéMON you've seen or caught.\\pIt's a high-tech encyclopedia!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_PleaseGiveMonsRest":"DAISY: Just like people, POKéMON\\nare living things.\\pWhen they get tired, please give\\nthem a rest.$","ViridianCity_Text_ViridiansGymLeaderReturned":"VIRIDIAN GYM's LEADER returned!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveEnoughMoney":"You don't have enough money.$","ViridianCity_House_Text_SpearowNameSpeary":"SPEAROW\\nName: SPEARY$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_MeteoriteThatFellOnMtMoon":"A meteorite that fell on MT. MOON.\\nIt is thought to be a MOON STONE.$","ViridianForest_Text_CharliePostBattle":"BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\\nThey're a lot of fun!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoDefeat":"Aiyah!$","Text_TakeYourPkmnForFewSeconds":"Okay, I'll take your POKéMON for a\\nfew seconds.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_SaveOptionInMenu":"The SAVE option is on the MENU.\\nUse it regularly.$","Route1_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 1\\nPALLET TOWN - VIRIDIAN CITY$","CableClub_Text_PleaseWaitBCancel":"Please wait.\\n… … B Button: Cancel$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_OopsWrongSide":"Oops, wrong side…$","Text_VideoGame":"It's the latest video game!\\nIt sure looks fun!$","PewterCity_Text_DidYouCheckOutMuseum":"Did you check out the MUSEUM?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThreeMonsChooseOne":"OAK: {RIVAL}?\\nLet me think…\\pOh, that's right, I told you to\\ncome! Just wait!\\pHere, {PLAYER}.\\pThere are three POKéMON here.\\pHaha!\\pThe POKéMON are held inside\\nthese POKé BALLS.\\pWhen I was young, I was a serious\\nPOKéMON TRAINER.\\pBut now, in my old age, I have\\nonly these three left.\\pYou can have one.\\nGo on, choose!$","Text_Food":"It should be packed with all kinds\\nof delicious things to eat.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberContainsGeneticMatter":"AMBER contains the genetic matter\\nof ancient POKéMON.\\pThere's a LAB somewhere trying to\\nresurrect POKéMON from AMBER.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLeaveItToMeGramps":"{RIVAL}: All right, Gramps!\\nLeave it all to me!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Its50YForChildsTicket":"Yes, yes.\\nIt's ¥50 for a child's ticket.\\pWould you like to come in?$","PalletTown_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu":"TRAINER TIPS\\pPress START to open the MENU!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetsGetHappening":"All right!\\nLet's get happening!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalWhatDidYouCallMeFor":"{RIVAL}: I almost forgot!\\nWhat did you call me for?$","PalletTown_Text_RaisingMonsToo":"I'm raising POKéMON, too.\\pWhen they get strong, they can\\nprotect me.$","PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsLearnTechniquesAsTheyGrow":"POKéMON learn new techniques as\\nthey grow.\\pBut some moves must be taught to\\nthem by people.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM26":"TM26 contains EARTHQUAKE.\\pIt is a powerful attack that causes\\na massive tremor.\\pI made it when I ran the GYM here,\\nfar too long ago… $","Text_Kitchen":"It smells delicious!\\nSomebody's been cooking here.$","PewterCity_Text_GoTakeOnBrock":"If you have the right stuff,\\ngo take on BROCK!$","Route3_Text_RobinDefeat":"That's it?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis":"You don't have space for this in\\nyour BAG.$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerRematchIntro":"The sea cleanses my body and soul!$","Route3_Text_ColtonIntro":"Hey!\\nI saw you in VIRIDIAN FOREST!$","PewterCity_Text_BrockOnlySeriousTrainerHere":"There aren't many serious POKéMON\\nTRAINERS here.\\pThey're all like BUG CATCHERS,\\nyou know, just hobbyists.\\pBut PEWTER GYM's BROCK isn't like\\nthat, not one bit.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_HeyDontLookAtMyNotes":"GIRL: Hey!\\nDon't look at my notes!$","ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouHowToCatchMons":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pHm?\\nWhat is that red box you have?\\pAh, so you're working on your\\nPOKéDEX.\\pThen let me give you a word of\\nadvice.\\pWhenever you catch a POKéMON,\\nthe POKéDEX automatically updates\\lits data.\\p…You don't know how to catch\\na POKéMON?\\pI suppose I had better show you\\nthen!$","CableClub_Text_ExplainWirelessClubFirstTime":"On the top floor, there are two\\nrooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$","Route3_Text_JanicePostBattle":"You shouldn't be staring if you\\ndon't want to battle!$","PalletTown_Text_OakDontGoOut":"OAK: Hey! Wait!\\nDon't go out!$","CableClub_Text_NotSetUpForFarAwayRegion":"I'm awfully sorry.\\pWe're not set up to conduct trades\\nwith TRAINERS far away in another\\lregion yet…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGrampsIsntAround":"{RIVAL}: What, it's only {PLAYER}?\\nGramps isn't around.$","Route3_Text_ColtonPostBattle":"There are other kinds of POKéMON\\nthan the ones you find in forests.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WhatsSpecialAboutMoonStone":"MOON STONE, huh?\\pWhat's so special about it?\\nLooks like an ordinary rock to me.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColePostBattle":"Wait!\\nI was just careless!$","Text_PokecenterSign":"Heal Your POKéMON!\\nPOKéMON CENTER$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeIntro":"Your POKéMON will cower at the\\ncrack of my whip!$","Route3_Text_SallyPostBattle":"You can avoid battles by not\\nletting TRAINERS see you.$","OneIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UsualPCServicesUnavailable":"The usual PC services aren't\\navailable…$","PalletTown_Text_SignsAreUsefulArentThey":"Signs are useful, aren't they?$","Text_RestoredPkmnToFullHealth":"Thank you for waiting.\\nWe've restored your POKéMON to\\lfull health.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThisMonIsEnergetic":"This POKéMON is really quite\\nenergetic!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_MayISeeFirstMon":"DAISY: Your POKéMON grow to love\\nyou if you raise them with love.\\pFor example, {PLAYER}, may I see\\nyour first POKéMON?$","Route1_Text_PutPotionAway":"{PLAYER} put the POTION away in\\nthe BAG's ITEMS POCKET.$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCentersHealMons":"POKéMON CENTERS heal your tired,\\nhurt, or fainted POKéMON.\\pThey make all POKéMON completely\\nhealthy.$","Text_TooBadBagFull":"Too bad!\\nThe BAG is full…$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFourthPage":"Fourth page…\\pThe ultimate goal for all POKéMON\\nTRAINERS is simple.\\pIt is to defeat the top eight\\nPOKéMON GYM LEADERS.\\pDo so to earn the right to face…\\pThe ELITE FOUR of the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE!$","Text_PleaseComeAgain":"Please come again!$","PewterCity_Text_ThisIsTheMuseum":"This is it, the MUSEUM.\\pYou have to pay to get in, but it's\\nworth it. See you around!$","Route3_Text_ColtonRematchIntro":"Hey!\\nI saw you in VIRIDIAN FOREST!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BeautifulPieceOfAmber":"There is a beautiful piece of\\nAMBER in a clear gold color.$","Route3_Text_CalvinIntro":"Hey! You're not wearing shorts!\\nWhat's wrong with you?$","Route1_Text_CanJumpFromLedges":"See those ledges along the road?\\pIt's a bit scary, but you can jump\\nfrom them.\\pYou can get back to PALLET TOWN\\nquicker that way.$","CableClub_Text_NeedBerryForBerryCrush":"To use the BERRY CRUSH service,\\nyou must have at least one BERRY.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory":"Blow me away! GIOVANNI was the\\nGYM LEADER of VIRIDIAN?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_KabutopsFossil":"KABUTOPS Fossil\\nA primitive and rare POKéMON.$","Route21_North_Text_WadeRematchIntro":"I got a big haul again!\\nWanna go for it once more?$","Route21_North_Text_LilRematchIntro":"LIL: Huh? A battle again?\\nIAN, can't you do it alone?$","CableClub_Text_OtherTrainerNotReady":"The other TRAINER is not ready.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AskedDaddyToCatchPikachu":"I want a PIKACHU!\\nIt's so cute!\\pI asked my daddy to catch me one!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedFivePokeBalls":"{PLAYER} received five POKé BALLS.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu":"Press START to open the MENU!$","Route3_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 3\\nMT. MOON AHEAD$","Text_ChangeYourProfile":"Would you like to change your\\nprofile?$","PokedexRating_Text_SeenXOwnedY":"The amount of progress you've made\\non your POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.\\p{FONT_NORMAL}PROF. OAK's rating:$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldIntro":"You want to know if the fish are\\nbiting?$","CableClub_Text_PleaseVisitAgain":"Please do visit again.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeDefeat":"Yowch!\\nWhiplash!$","Aide_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForItem":"Oh! I see you don't have any\\nroom for the {STR_VAR_2}.$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalDefeat":"Awww!\\nYou just lucked out!$","ViridianForest_Text_DougDefeat":"Huh?\\nI ran out of POKéMON!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamDefeat":"Darn!\\pLight-years isn't time…\\nIt measures distance!$","PewterCity_Text_SwitchedShoesWithRunningShoes":"{PLAYER} switched shoes with the\\nRUNNING SHOES.$","Trade_Text_WhatThatsNoMon":"What?\\nThat's no {STR_VAR_1}!$","Text_ThankYouForAccessingMysteryGift":"Thank you for accessing the\\nMYSTERY GIFT System.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHeyDontGoAwayYet":"OAK: Hey!\\nDon't go away yet!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_TryDifferentPartyOrders":"The first POKéMON out in a match is\\nat the left of the POKéMON LIST.\\pBy changing the order of POKéMON,\\nyou may gain an advantage.\\pTry different orders to suit your\\nopponent's party.$","Text_Dresser":"It's a nicely made dresser.\\nIt will hold a lot of stuff.$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_CanGetThroughRockTunnel":"Once a POKéMON learns FLASH, you\\ncan get through ROCK TUNNEL.$","Route21_North_Text_LilIntro":"LIL: Huh? A battle?\\nIAN, can't you do it alone?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainPoison":"When poisoned, a POKéMON's health\\nsteadily drops.\\pPoison lingers after battles.\\nUse an ANTIDOTE to cure poison!$","Trade_Text_IsntMyOldMonGreat":"Isn't my old {STR_VAR_2} great?$","Text_WeHopeToSeeYouAgain":"We hope to see you again!$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerDefeat":"Ayah!$","ViridianForest_Text_CharlieIntro":"Did you know that POKéMON evolve?$","Text_Blueprints":"It's a blueprint of some sort.\\nIt's filled with diagrams and text.$","Text_WhatsYourProfile":"What's your profile?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"PEWTER POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","Text_PowerPlantMachine":"What could this machine be?\\nBetter not mess around with it!$","Text_IdLoveToHearYourProfile":"Hi, glad to meet you!\\p…That's unfriendly of you.\\nHow about saying hi back?\\pSo, come on, tell me about\\nyourself.\\pI'd love to hear your profile!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_2F_Text_PlayedWithNES":"{PLAYER} played with the NES.\\p…Okay!\\nIt's time to go!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNeedYourHelpTooNeedToSeePokedexes":"OAK: I know, I know.\\nOf course I need your help, too.\\pNow, I need to see both your\\nPOKéDEXES.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_TakeThisToProfOak":"You know PROF. OAK, right?\\pHis order came in.\\nCan I get you to take it to him?$","CableClub_Text_FirstTimeRightThisWay":"Hello!\\nMy name is TEALA.\\pThis must be your first time\\nup here.\\pI'll show you how the Wireless\\nCommunication System works.\\pFirst, I need to show you this\\nfloor of our POKéMON CENTER.\\pRight this way, please.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_HiBrothersAtLab":"DAISY: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\pMy brother, {RIVAL}, is out at\\nGrandpa's LAB.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_GetOldAmberChecked":"Ssh!\\nGet the OLD AMBER checked!$","Text_Bookshelf":"It's crammed full of POKéMON\\nbooks.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_EmailMessage":"There's an e-mail message here.\\p…\\pFinally!\\nThe ultimate TRAINERS of the\\lPOKéMON LEAGUE are ready to\\ltake on all comers!\\pBring your best POKéMON and see\\nhow you rate as a TRAINER!\\pPOKéMON LEAGUE HQ\\nINDIGO PLATEAU\\pPROF. OAK, please visit us!\\n…$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_YouCameFromPallet":"Hey!\\nYou came from PALLET TOWN?$","ViridianCity_Text_GymClosedWonderWhoLeaderIs":"This POKéMON GYM is always closed.\\pI wonder who the LEADER is?$","ViridianCity_Text_CanCarryMonsAnywhere":"Those POKé BALLS at your waist!\\nYou have POKéMON, don't you?\\pIt's great that you can carry and\\nuse POKéMON anytime, anywhere.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockDefeat":"I took you for granted, and so\\nI lost.\\pAs proof of your victory, I confer\\non you this…the official POKéMON\\lLEAGUE BOULDERBADGE.\\p{FONT_NORMAL}{PLAYER} received the BOULDERBADGE\\nfrom BROCK!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\\p{FONT_MALE}Just having the BOULDERBADGE makes\\nyour POKéMON more powerful.\\pIt also enables the use of the\\nmove FLASH outside of battle.\\pOf course, a POKéMON must know the\\nmove FLASH to use it.$","Route3_Text_JaniceDefeat":"You're mean!$","Route22_Text_LateRivalPostBattle":"That loosened me up.\\nI'm ready for the POKéMON LEAGUE!\\p{PLAYER}, you need more practice.\\pBut hey, you know that!\\nI'm out of here. Smell ya!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalJustLetMeHandleEverything":"{RIVAL}: Hey, I heard that!\\pGramps, what's with favoring\\n{PLAYER} over me all the time?\\pI went and collected more POKéMON,\\nand faster, too.\\pYou should just let me handle\\neverything.$","Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_RattataHasWickedBite":"RATTATA may be small, but don't\\nunderestimate its wicked bite.\\pHave you caught one already?$","CableClub_Text_DirectYouToYourRoom":"I'll direct you to your room now.$","Route2_Text_DiglettsCave":"DIGLETT'S CAVE$","PewterCity_Text_ReceivedRunningShoesFromAide":"{PLAYER} received the\\nRUNNING SHOES from the AIDE.$","Route21_North_Text_LilDefeat":"LIL: Oh, see?\\nWe lost. Happy now?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingSquirtle":"Hm! SQUIRTLE is your choice.\\nIt's one worth raising.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you've decided on the\\nWATER POKéMON SQUIRTLE?$","ViridianForest_Text_RickPostBattle":"Ssh! You'll scare the bugs away.\\nAnother time, okay?$","ViridianCity_House_Text_MyDaddyLovesMonsToo":"My daddy loves POKéMON, too.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedPokedexFromOak":"{PLAYER} received the POKéDEX\\nfrom PROF. OAK.$","PalletTown_Text_CanStoreItemsAndMonsInPC":"Technology is incredible!\\pYou can now store and recall items\\nand POKéMON as data via PC.$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerPostBattle":"The sea is great and all, but I\\nlike the mountains, too.$","PewterCity_Text_ExplainRunningShoes":"Press the B Button to run.\\nBut only where there's room to run!$","PewterCity_Text_MuseumOfScience":"PEWTER MUSEUM OF SCIENCE$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelIntro":"VIRIDIAN GYM was closed for a\\nlong time.\\pBut now, our LEADER is back!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AerodactylFossil":"AERODACTYL Fossil\\nA primitive and rare POKéMON.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsWarmingUpToYou":"It's warming up to you.\\nTrust must be growing between you.$","Text_TreeCanBeCutDown":"This tree looks like it can be CUT\\ndown!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTookBothPokedexUnits":"PROF. OAK took both POKéDEX\\nunits.$","Text_PokeMartShelf":"Wow!\\nTons of POKéMON stuff!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenPostBattle":"The LEADER will scold me for\\nlosing this way…$","PalletTown_Text_ReadItReadIt":"Read it, read it!$","PewterCity_Text_ReallyYouHaveToGo":"Really?\\nYou absolutely have to go!$","Text_OnlyPassWithBadgeDontHaveYet":"You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet.\\pYou have to have it to get to\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllCompleteThePokedex":"{RIVAL}: Gramps, calm down.\\nDon't get so excited.\\pI'll get the POKéDEX completed,\\ndon't you worry about a thing.\\pI think I'll try looking around\\nONE ISLAND first…\\pAnyways, I'm outta here!$","Text_HiWeMeetAgain":"Hi!\\nWe meet again!$","ViridianCity_Text_GrandpaHasntHadCoffeeYet":"Oh, Grandpa!\\nDon't be so mean!\\pI'm so sorry.\\nHe hasn't had his coffee yet.$","ViridianForest_Text_AvoidGrassyAreasWhenWeak":"TRAINER TIPS\\pIf your POKéMON are weak and you\\nwant to avoid battles, stay away\\lfrom grassy areas!$","CableClub_Text_PlayWhichBattleMode":"Which Battle Mode would you like\\nto play?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakSightingsOfRareMons":"Recently, there have been sightings\\nof many rare POKéMON species.\\pI'm talking about POKéMON that\\nhave never been seen in KANTO.\\pI would love to go see things for\\nmyself, but I'm much too old.\\pSince I can't do it, {PLAYER}, I'd\\nlike you to go in my place.$","Route3_Text_JamesRematchIntro":"I'll battle you with the POKéMON\\nI started raising.$","Text_FoundOneItem":"{PLAYER} found one {STR_VAR_2}!$","PalletTown_Text_RivalsHouse":"{RIVAL}'s house$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiPostBattle":"You'll need power to keep up with\\nour GYM LEADER.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM39":"A TM, Technical Machine, contains a\\ntechnique for POKéMON.\\pUsing a TM teaches the move it\\ncontains to a POKéMON.\\pA TM is good for only one use.\\pSo, when you use one, pick the\\nPOKéMON carefully.\\pAnyways…\\nTM39 contains ROCK TOMB.\\pIt hurls boulders at the foe and\\nlowers its SPEED.$","Route3_Text_GregDefeat":"If I had new POKéMON, I would've\\nwon!$","PewterCity_Text_ThatsRightItsHardWork":"That's right!\\nIt's hard work!$","Route1_Text_ComeSeeUsIfYouNeedPokeBalls":"Please come see us if you need\\nPOKé BALLS for catching POKéMON.$","Text_WirelessClubUndergoingAdjustments":"I'm terribly sorry.\\nThe POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB is\\lundergoing adjustments now.$","Text_TrashBin":"Inside this…\\n……\\pThere's nothing here!$","Route3_Text_BenIntro":"Hi!\\nI like shorts!\\pThey're delightfully comfy and\\neasy to wear!$","CableClub_Text_PleaseConfirmNumberAndRestart":"Please confirm the number of\\nplayers and start again.$","ViridianForest_Text_LeavingViridianForest":"LEAVING VIRIDIAN FOREST\\nPEWTER CITY AHEAD$","Text_CantLetYouPass":"Rules are rules.\\nI can't let you pass.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsBigMapOfKanto":"It's a big map of the KANTO region.\\nNow this would be useful!$","CableClub_Text_PlayersMadeDifferentSelections":"The link partners appear to have\\nmade different selections.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsAuthorityOnMons":"PROF. OAK may not look like much,\\nbut he's the authority on POKéMON.\\pMany POKéMON TRAINERS hold him in\\nhigh regard.$","Text_AccessedBillsPC":"Accessed BILL's PC.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainParalysis":"Paralysis reduces SPEED and may\\nprevent the POKéMON from moving.\\pParalysis remains after battles.\\nUse PARLYZ HEAL for treatment.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DaisyWillGroomMons":"Hi, {PLAYER}. I bet you've become\\ngood friends with your POKéMON.\\pBy the way, did you know about\\nDAISY?\\pIf you show DAISY your POKéMON,\\nshe can tell how much it likes you.\\pOccasionally, she will even groom\\na POKéMON for you.\\pThis is a secret, so please don't\\ntell anyone.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ReceivedOldAmberFromMan":"{PLAYER} received the OLD AMBER\\nfrom the man.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItLooksVeryHappy":"It looks very happy.\\pI wish {RIVAL} could see this and\\nlearn something from it.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoPostBattle":"If my POKéMON were as good at\\nkarate as I…$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_DontHaveRoomForThis":"You don't have room for this.$","Text_Telephone":"It's a telephone.\\nBetter not use it.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DeliveredOaksParcel":"{PLAYER} delivered OAK'S PARCEL.$","ViridianCity_Text_MyGrandsonOnTheShow":"Wahaha!\\nIt's my grandson on the show!\\pSince he's the one doing the\\nteaching, you're bound to learn.$","CableClub_Text_NoEnigmaBerryInUnionRoom":"No POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY may enter the UNION ROOM.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou":"Wait!\\nTake this with you.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ComeAgain":"Come again!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiPostBattle":"I'm still not worthy!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LovelyAndSweetClefairy":"“The lovely and sweet\\nCLEFAIRY”$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ShelvesCrammedFullOfBooks":"The shelves are crammed full of\\nbooks on POKéMON.$","Text_BeautifulSkyWindow":"Outside the window…\\pThe sky looks fantastically\\nbeautiful.$","Text_OpenedPkmnStorage":"POKéMON Storage System opened.$","CableClub_Text_AskAboutLinking":"Hello, {PLAYER}!\\pIt's me, TEALA, the POKéMON\\nCENTER 2F attendant.\\pIs there something you needed to\\nask me about linking?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookSecondPage":"Second page…\\pA healthy POKéMON may be hard to\\ncatch, so weaken it first.\\pPoison, burn, or cause another\\nstatus problem to weaken it.$","PalletTown_Text_TownSign":"PALLET TOWN\\nShades of your journey await!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OaksLastMon":"That's PROF. OAK's last POKéMON.$","Text_CutTreeDown":"This tree looks like it can be CUT\\ndown!\\pWould you like to CUT it?$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyDefeat":"I give!\\nYou're good at this!$","Text_OnlyPassWithBadgeOhGoAhead":"You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pOh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_LEVEL_UP}{PAUSE 0x60}{RESUME_MUSIC}\\pOkay, then.\\nPlease, go right ahead.$","Text_MoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce":"This move can be learned only\\nonce. Is that okay?$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TeamRocketMtMoonImOnPhone":"What!?\\pTEAM ROCKET is at MT. MOON?\\nHuh?\\pI'm on the phone!\\nScram!$","Text_ClosedLinkToProfOaksPC":"Closed link to PROF. OAK's PC.$","PalletTown_Text_OakPokemonResearchLab":"OAK POKéMON RESEARCH LAB$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyDefeat":"Oh, boo.\\nNothing went right.$","Text_DecorTransferredToPC":"The {STR_VAR_2} was transferred\\nto the PC.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockPostBattle":"There are all kinds of TRAINERS in\\nthis huge world of ours.\\pYou appear to be very gifted as a\\nPOKéMON TRAINER.\\pSo let me make a suggestion.\\pGo to the GYM in CERULEAN and test\\nyour abilities.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamPostBattle":"You're pretty hot.\\n…But not as hot as BROCK!$","Trade_Text_AwwOhWell":"Awww!\\nOh, well…$","ViridianCity_Text_GymDoorsAreLocked":"VIRIDIAN GYM's doors are locked…$","PalletTown_Text_OakGrassUnsafeNeedMon":"OAK: It's unsafe!\\nWild POKéMON live in tall grass!\\pYou need your own POKéMON for\\nyour protection.\\pI know!\\nHere, come with me!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonPostBattle":"Do you know the identity of our\\nGYM LEADER?$","Text_DecidedNotTo":"Oh, you've decided not to?\\nYou're fickle, aren't you?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_TurnThePage":"Turn the page?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakAddedNothingToPokedex":"Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nHow is your POKéDEX shaping up?\\p{RIVAL} has already caught some\\nPOKéMON and added to the data.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, let's have a look at\\nyour POKéDEX.\\p…What's the matter?\\nYou've added no new data at all.\\pI'll give you these, so do try a\\nlittle harder.$","Text_SeismicTossTeach":"The secrets of space…\\nThe mysteries of earth…\\pThere are so many things about\\nwhich we know so little.\\pBut that should spur us to study\\nharder, not toss in the towel.\\pThe only thing you should toss…\\pWell, how about SEISMIC TOSS?\\nShould I teach that to a POKéMON?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LikeMeToGroomMon":"DAISY: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\nGood timing.\\pI'm about to have some tea.\\nWould you like to join me?\\pOh, but look.\\nYour POKéMON are a little dirty.\\pWould you like me to groom one?$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCancelEvolution":"Do you know the evolution-cancel\\ntechnique?\\pWhen a POKéMON is evolving, you\\ncan stop the process.\\pIt's a technique for raising\\nPOKéMON the way they are.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_StudyAsOaksAide":"I study POKéMON as PROF. OAK's\\nAIDE.$","ViridianCity_Text_GymSign":"VIRIDIAN CITY POKéMON GYM$","Route3_Text_RobinIntro":"Eek!\\nDid you touch me?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalFedUpWithWaiting":"{RIVAL}: Gramps!\\nI'm fed up with waiting!$","PewterCity_House1_Text_Nidoran":"NIDORAN♂: Bowbow!$","ViridianCity_Text_CitySign":"VIRIDIAN CITY \\nThe Eternally Green Paradise$","Route3_Text_CalvinDefeat":"Lost!\\nLost! Lost!$","Route3_Text_SallyIntro":"That look you gave me…\\nIt's so intriguing!$","Route3_Text_CalvinPostBattle":"I always wear shorts, even in\\nwinter. That's my policy.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonDefeat":"You are in perfect harmony!$","Trade_Text_HeyThanks":"Hey, thanks!$","CableClub_Text_HopeToSeeYouAgain":"I hope to see you again!$","Text_HeardThatBefore":"Oh, I've heard that before…\\pMy cousin, who lives far away,\\nalways used to say that, I think.$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCutSkinnyTrees":"Have you noticed the skinny trees\\non the roadside?\\pThey can be cut down by a special\\nPOKéMON move, I hear.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookThirdPage":"Third page…\\pPOKéMON TRAINERS seek others to\\nengage in POKéMON battles.\\pTo TRAINERS, the taste of victory\\nis sweet, indeed.\\pBattles are constantly waged at\\nPOKéMON GYMS everywhere.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoIntro":"Karate is the ultimate form of\\nmartial arts!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsQuiteFriendly":"It's quite friendly with you.\\nKeep being good to it!$","PokedexRating_Text_HowIsPokedexComingAlong":"OAK: Good to see you!\\nHow is your POKéDEX coming along?\\pHere, let me take a look.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ShouldBeGratefulForLongLife":"I should be grateful for my long\\nlife.\\pNever did I think I would get to\\nsee the bones of a dragon!$","Text_WouldYouLikeToMixRecords":"Would you like to mix records with\\nother TRAINERS?$","Text_GiveNicknameToThisMon":"Do you want to give a nickname to\\nthis {STR_VAR_1}?$","Text_AccessedSomeonesPC":"Accessed Someone's PC.$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WhenJiggylypuffSingsMonsGetDrowsy":"Yawn!\\pWhen JIGGLYPUFF sings, POKéMON get\\ndrowsy…\\p…Me, too…\\nSnore…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniIntro":"Fwahahaha!\\nWelcome to my hideout!\\pIt shall be so until I can restore\\nTEAM ROCKET to its former glory.\\pBut, you have found me again.\\nSo be it.\\lThis time, I'm not holding back!\\pOnce more, you shall face\\nGIOVANNI, the greatest TRAINER!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GiveHM05IfSeen10Mons":"Hi! Remember me?\\nI'm one of PROF. OAK's AIDES.\\pIf your POKéDEX has complete data\\non ten species, I'm supposed to\\lgive you a reward.\\pPROF. OAK entrusted me with\\nHM05 for you.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, let me ask you.\\pHave you gathered data on at least\\nten kinds of POKéMON?$","Text_DreamEaterTaught":"…ZZZ…\\nI…can't eat…anymore…$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainSleep":"A POKéMON can't attack if it's\\nasleep.\\pPOKéMON will stay asleep even\\nafter battles.\\pUse AWAKENING to awaken one\\nfrom sleep.$","PalletTown_Text_OakYouEnjoyingTraveling":"OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nYou seem to be enjoying traveling.\\pKnowing you, {PLAYER}, I can easily\\nimagine you going out to even more\\lexotic locales.\\pGood for you, good for you.\\nHohoho.$","ViridianCity_Text_OhOkayThen":"Oh, okay then!$","Text_Snacks":"There's a pile of snacks here.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_GroomWhichOne":"Which one should I groom?$","Text_ExplainProfile":"A profile is written using four\\nwords or phrases.\\pThere're plenty of words to choose\\nfrom for your profile.\\pThe words and phrases are placed\\nin several convenient groups.\\pFirst, choose a group, then choose\\na word or phrase.\\p…It's easier than it sounds.\\nWhy don't you try it?$","Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_ForestIsMaze":"Are you going to VIRIDIAN FOREST?\\nIt's a natural maze in there.\\lBe careful you don't get lost.$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: Hey! {PLAYER}!\\pYou're off to the POKéMON LEAGUE?\\nForget about it!\\pYou probably don't have any\\nBADGES, do you?\\pThe guard won't let you through\\nwithout them.\\pBy the way, did your POKéMON get\\nany stronger?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllTakeThisOneThen":"{RIVAL}: I'll take this one, then!$","PewterCity_Text_CitySign":"PEWTER CITY\\nA Stone Gray City$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ThoseArePokeBalls":"Those are POKé BALLS.\\nThey contain POKéMON!$","Route3_Text_RobinRematchIntro":"Eek!\\nDid you push me?$","CableClub_Text_HopeYouEnjoyWirelessSystem":"I hope you enjoy the Wireless\\nCommunication System.$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldRematchIntro":"You want to know if the fish are\\nbiting?$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ExplainHM05":"HM05 contains the hidden move\\nFLASH.\\pFLASH lights up even the darkest\\nof caves and dungeons.$","Route22_Text_LateRivalDefeat":"What!?\\pI was just careless, you!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelDefeat":"I was beaten?$","ViridianCity_House_Text_Speary":"SPEARY: Tetweet!$","CableClub_Text_CantTradeEnigmaBerry":"A POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY can't be traded.$","Text_SeismicTossWhichMon":"Which POKéMON wants to learn\\nSEISMIC TOSS?$","PewterCity_Text_GymSign":"PEWTER CITY POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\lThe Rock-Solid POKéMON TRAINER!$","Text_PlayerFacingTVScreen":"There's a POKéMON on TV!\\nIt looks like it's having fun.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCatchMonsForDataTakeThese":"OAK: You can't get detailed data\\non POKéMON by just seeing them.\\pYou must catch them to obtain\\ncomplete data.\\pSo, here are some tools for\\ncatching wild POKéMON.$","Text_TastyFood":"Oh, that smells tasty!\\nIt might get the stomach growling!$","ViridianForest_Text_DougPostBattle":"That totally stinks! I'm going to\\ncatch some stronger ones!$","PokedexRating_Text_ThankYouMadeDreamReality":"Thank you, {PLAYER}!\\nSincerely, thank you!\\lYou've made my dream a reality!$","PewterCity_Text_WerentThoseFossilsAmazing":"Weren't those fossils from MT. MOON\\namazing?$","CableClub_Text_YouHaveAMonThatCantBeTaken":"You have at least one POKéMON\\nthat can't be taken.$","Text_ObtainedTheDecor":"Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$","Text_ATownMap":"A TOWN MAP.$","Route21_North_Text_IanDefeat":"IAN: Awww, Sis!\\nGet it together!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGramps":"{RIVAL}: Gramps!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis":"You don't have space for this.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ItsFreeLetsGetHappening":"It's a free service!\\nLet's get happening!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakExplainCatching":"When a wild POKéMON appears,\\nit's fair game.\\pJust throw a POKé BALL at it and\\ntry to catch it!\\pThis won't always work, however.\\pA healthy POKéMON can escape.\\nYou have to be lucky!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YouDoNotHaveSpace":"You do not have space for this!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniDefeat":"Ha!\\nThat was a truly intense fight.\\lYou have won!\\pAs proof, here is the EARTHBADGE!\\n{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyIntro":"Hey, wait up!\\nWhat's the hurry? Why the rush?$","Route3_Text_CalvinRematchIntro":"Hey! What's wrong with you?\\nYou're still not wearing shorts!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingCharmander":"Ah! CHARMANDER is your choice.\\nYou should raise it patiently.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you're claiming the\\nFIRE POKéMON CHARMANDER?$","ViridianCity_Text_CatchMonsForEasierBattles":"TRAINER TIPS\\pCatch POKéMON and expand your\\ncollection.\\pThe more you have, the easier it\\nis to battle.$","Route3_Text_GregPostBattle":"If a POKéMON BOX on the PC gets\\nfull, just switch to another BOX.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"PEWTER POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","ViridianForest_Text_ContactOakViaPCToRatePokedex":"TRAINER TIPS\\pContact PROF. OAK via a PC to\\nget your POKéDEX evaluated!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_RunningSpaceExhibitThisMonth":"This month, we're running a space\\nexhibit.$","Route2_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 2\\nVIRIDIAN CITY - PEWTER CITY$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Right50YThankYou":"Right, ¥50!\\nThank you!$","ViridianForest_Text_DougIntro":"Yo!\\nYou can't jam out if you're a\\lPOKéMON TRAINER!$","Route3_Text_BenPostBattle":"Are you using a POKéMON CENTER's\\nPC for storing your POKéMON?\\pEach BOX can hold up to\\n30 POKéMON.$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GreatHereYouGo":"Great! You have caught or owned\\n{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\\pCongratulations!\\nHere you go!$","Route3_Text_JamesPostBattle":"Trained POKéMON are stronger than\\nthe wild ones.$","Route3_Text_JamesDefeat":"Done like dinner!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_2F_Text_PressLRForHelp":"It's a posted notice…\\pIf you're confused, ask for HELP!\\nPress the L or R Button!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalTellSisNotToGiveYouMap":"{PLAYER}, I hate to say it, but you\\nwon't be necessary for this.\\pI know! I'll borrow a TOWN MAP\\nfrom my sis!\\pI'll tell her not to lend you one,\\n{PLAYER}! Hahaha!\\pDon't bother coming around to\\nmy place after this!$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureProfOak":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PROF. OAK,\\nthe POKéMON Researcher!\\pPROF. OAK reportedly lives with his\\ngrandchildren DAISY and {RIVAL}.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BoughtColorTVForMoonLanding":"July 20, 1969!\\pHumankind first set foot on the\\nmoon that day.\\pI bought a color TV just so I\\ncould watch that news.$","CableClub_Text_UseBerryCrush":"Would you like to use the\\nBERRY CRUSH System?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ThereYouGoAllDone":"{FONT_NORMAL}{STR_VAR_1} looks dreamily content…\\p{FONT_FEMALE}DAISY: There you go! All done.\\nSee? Doesn't it look nice?\\pGiggle…\\nIt's such a cute POKéMON.$","ViridianCity_Text_WantToKnowAboutCaterpillarMons":"You want to know about the two\\nkinds of caterpillar POKéMON?$","PokedexRating_Text_LoveSeeingYourPokedex":"OAK: Ah, welcome!\\pTell me, how is your POKéDEX\\ncoming along?\\pWahaha!\\pActually, I know how it is, but I\\nlove seeing it anyway!\\pLet's see…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoToughenMyMon":"{RIVAL}: Okay! I'll make my\\nPOKéMON battle to toughen it up!\\p{PLAYER}! Gramps!\\nSmell you later!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PlayersPokedexWasUpgraded":"{PLAYER}'s POKéDEX was upgraded!$","Route3_Text_BenRematchIntro":"Hi! I like shorts!\\nThey're comfy and easy to wear!\\pYou should be wearing shorts, too!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelPostBattle":"You can go on to the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE only by defeating our GYM\\lLEADER!$","PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsEasierCatchIfStatused":"A POKéMON becomes easier to \\ncatch if it has a status problem.\\pSleep, poison, burn, or paralysis…\\nThose are all effective.\\pBut catching POKéMON is never\\na sure thing!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_WhyWouldMonHateYouSoMuch":"…Um, it's not easy for me to say\\nthis, but…\\pIs there some reason why your\\nPOKéMON would hate you so much?$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsForDoubleBattle":"For a DOUBLE BATTLE, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.$","Text_BlinkingLights":"Lights in different colors are\\nflashing on and off.$","Text_TellMoreNextTime":"Please tell me more about\\nyourself next time!$","PalletTown_Text_CaughtXImpressiveFollowMe":"You've caught… {STR_VAR_2}!?\\nNow, this is impressive!\\pThere's something I wanted to ask\\nof you, {PLAYER}.\\pCome.\\nFollow me.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_YoureChampMaterial":"Just as I thought!\\nYou're POKéMON champ material!$","PewterCity_Text_MustBeGoingBackToLab":"Well, I must be going back to\\nthe LAB.\\pBye-bye!$","CableClub_Text_PleaseEnter":"Please enter.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_GotToBuySomePotions":"I've got to buy some POTIONS.\\pYou never know when your POKéMON\\nwill need quick healing.$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureBrock":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PEWTER GYM\\nLEADER BROCK!\\pBROCK rarely laughs, but is said to\\nbe unable to stop if he starts.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_AllGirlsLeaveOakLookingForYou":"MOM: …Right.\\nAll girls dream of traveling.\\lIt said so on TV.\\pOh, yes. PROF. OAK, next door, was\\nlooking for you.$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCenterInEveryTown":"There's a POKéMON CENTER in every\\ntown ahead.\\pThey charge no money, so don't\\nbe shy about healing POKéMON.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiIntro":"I'm the KARATE KING!\\nYour fate rests with me!$","Text_PokemartSign":"All your item needs fulfilled!\\nPOKéMON MART$","PalletTown_Text_CaughtXPuttingInHonestEffort":"You've caught {STR_VAR_2}…\\pHm, it looks as if you're putting\\nin an honest effort.\\pWhen you manage to fill it some\\nmore, come show me, please.$","ViridianForest_Text_RanOutOfPokeBalls":"I was throwing POKé BALLS to\\ncatch POKéMON, and I ran out.\\pThat's why you can never have too\\nmany POKé BALLS.$","PokedexRating_Text_LookForwardToFilledNationalDex":"I'll be looking forward to seeing\\nyou fill the NATIONAL POKéDEX!$","ViridianCity_Text_MovesLimitedByPP":"TRAINER TIPS\\pThe battle moves of POKéMON are\\nlimited by their POWER POINTS, PP.\\pTo replenish PP, rest your tired\\nPOKéMON at a POKéMON CENTER.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockIntro":"So, you're here. I'm BROCK.\\nI'm PEWTER's GYM LEADER.\\pMy rock-hard willpower is evident\\neven in my POKéMON.\\pMy POKéMON are all rock hard, and\\nhave true-grit determination.\\pThat's right - my POKéMON are all\\nthe ROCK type!\\pFuhaha! You're going to challenge\\nme knowing that you'll lose?\\pThat's the TRAINER's honor that\\ncompels you to challenge me.\\pFine, then!\\nShow me your best!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WantYouToGetAmberExamined":"Ssh! Listen, I need to share a\\nsecret with someone.\\pI think that this chunk of AMBER\\ncontains POKéMON DNA!\\pIt would be a shattering scientific\\nbreakthrough if POKéMON could be\\lresurrected from it.\\pBut, my colleagues just ignore\\nwhat I have to say.\\pSo, I have a favor to ask!\\pI want you to get this examined at\\na POKéMON LAB somewhere.$","ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pBut I made it too strong.\\nIt gave me a headache…\\pIncidentally, are you filling your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pAt first, focus on weakening the\\nPOKéMON before trying to catch it.$","PalletTown_Text_PlayersHouse":"{PLAYER}'s house$","ViridianCity_Text_ThatWasEducationalTakeThis":"There! Now tell me, that was\\neducational, was it not?\\pAnd here, take this, too.$","Route21_North_Text_IanPostBattle":"IAN: Come on, Sis!\\pYou're not going to lose weight\\nlike this!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WeHaveTwoFossilsOnExhibit":"We have two fossils of rare,\\nprehistoric POKéMON on exhibit.$","Route3_Text_JaniceRematchIntro":"Excuse me!\\nYou keep looking at me, don't you?$","PewterCity_Text_DoYouKnowWhatImDoing":"Psssst!\\nDo you know what I'm doing?$","PalletTown_Text_LookCopiedTrainerTipsSign":"Look, look!\\pI copied what it said on one of\\nthose TRAINER TIPS signs!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MovieOnTVGirlOnBrickRoad":"There's a movie on TV.\\nA girl with her hair in pigtails is\\lwalking up a brick road.\\p…I better go, too.$","Text_AccessedPlayersPC":"Accessed {PLAYER}'s PC.$","Text_OhThatsBadgeGoRightAhead":"Oh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!\\nGo right ahead.$","CableClub_Text_TradePokemon":"Would you like to trade POKéMON?$","Text_Computer":"It's all complicated words and\\nnumbers that make no sense…$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PleaseEnjoyYourself":"Please enjoy yourself.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PikachuSoonIPromise":"Yeah, a PIKACHU soon, I promise!$","CableClub_Text_IncorrectNumberOfParticipants":"The number of participants is\\nincorrect.$","Text_ObtainedTheX":"Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_CantGroomAnEgg":"Oh, sorry. I honestly can't\\ngroom an EGG.$","Route21_North_Text_LilPostBattle":"LIL: I'm tired.\\nCan't we go home already?$","PewterCity_Text_AskedToDeliverThis":"I'm glad I caught up to you.\\nI'm PROF. OAK's AIDE.\\pI've been asked to deliver this,\\nso here you go.$","Route3_Text_TunnelFromCeruleanTiring":"Whew… I better take a rest…\\nGroan…\\pThat tunnel from CERULEAN takes a\\nlot out of you!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadBlackboardCarefully":"Okay!\\pBe sure to read what's on the\\nblackboard carefully!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberIsFossilizedSap":"AMBER is actually sap, that gooey\\nstuff that oozes from trees.\\pThe ancient sap fossilized over\\ntime to become rock-hard AMBER.$","CableClub_Text_LinkErrorPleaseReset":"Sorry, we have a link error…\\nPlease reset and try again.$","Text_WelcomeWantToHealPkmn":"Welcome to our POKéMON CENTER!\\pWould you like me to heal your\\nPOKéMON back to perfect health?$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsToTrade":"For trading, you must have at\\nleast two POKéMON with you.$","Text_AccessWhichPC":"Which PC should be accessed?$","Route3_Text_SallyRematchIntro":"That look you give me…\\nIt intrigues me so!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MovieOnTVFourBoysOnRailroad":"There's a movie on TV.\\nFour boys are walking on railroad\\ltracks.\\p…I better go, too.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCustomBallIOrdered":"Ah! \\nIt's the custom POKé BALL!\\pI had it on order.\\nThank you!$","Text_SeismicTossTaught":"I hope you won't toss in the towel.\\nKeep it up.$","CableClub_Text_ExplainBattleModes":"There are three Battle Modes.\\pSINGLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.\\pDOUBLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith two or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER will send out two\\nPOKéMON in battle at a time.\\pMULTI BATTLE is for four TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.$","Aide_Text_HaventCaughtEnoughMonsForItem":"Let's see…\\nUh-oh! You have caught only\\l{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\\pYou need {STR_VAR_1} kinds\\nif you want the {STR_VAR_2}.$","CableClub_Text_EnjoyUnionRoom":"I hope you enjoy your time in\\nthe UNION ROOM.$","Text_PlayerBootedUpPC":"{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$","ViridianCity_Text_TooBusyForTeachyTV":"Hm… You're too busy to not even\\nhave the time for TEACHY TV…\\pTime is money, and neither should\\nbe ill spent…$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_YouShouldTakeQuickRest":"MOM: {PLAYER}!\\nYou should take a quick rest.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTakeTheseWithYou":"OAK: {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}.\\nTake these with you.$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeaderOfFour":"Please decide which of you four\\nwill become the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ReceivedHM05FromAide":"{PLAYER} received HM05\\nfrom the AIDE.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_TryingToMemorizeNotes":"Whew! I'm trying to memorize all my\\nnotes.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMonsAroundWorldWait":"POKéMON around the world wait for\\nyou, {PLAYER}!$","Route3_Text_BenDefeat":"I don't believe it!$","Text_OnlySkilledTrainersAllowedThrough":"Only truly skilled TRAINERS are\\nallowed through.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet!$","Route22_Text_LeagueGateSign":"POKéMON LEAGUE\\nFront Gate$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_LookingGreatTakeCare":"MOM: Oh, good! You and your\\nPOKéMON are looking great.\\lTake care now!$","Route2_House_Text_FaintedMonsCanUseFieldMoves":"A fainted POKéMON just has no\\nenergy left to battle.\\pIt can still use moves like CUT\\noutside of battle.$","Text_DontBeLikeThat":"Aww… Don't be like that.\\nYou can tell me your profile.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetMeTakeYouToTheTop":"Hiya!\\nDo you want to dream big?\\pDo you dare to dream of becoming\\nthe POKéMON champ?\\pI'm no TRAINER, but I can advise\\nyou on how to win.\\pLet me take you to the top!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: GIOVANNI\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","Text_AdvertisingPoster":"It's an advertising poster about\\nall kinds of products.$","Text_NeatlyLinedUpTools":"All sorts of tools are lined up\\nneatly.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: ?\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainEarthBadgeTakeThis":"The EARTHBADGE makes POKéMON of\\nany level obey without question.\\pIt is evidence of your mastery as\\na POKéMON TRAINER.\\pWith it, you can challenge the\\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.\\pAlso, take this TM.\\pConsider it a gift for your POKéMON\\nLEAGUE challenge.$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Jigglypuff":"JIGGLYPUFF: Puu pupuu!$","PewterCity_House1_Text_TradeMonsAreFinicky":"Our POKéMON's an outsider, so it's\\nfinicky and hard to handle.\\pAn outsider is a POKéMON that you\\nget in a trade.\\pIt grows fast, but it may ignore an\\nunskilled TRAINER in battle.\\pIf only we had some BADGES…$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldDefeat":"Dang!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenDefeat":"I lost my grip!$","Route21_North_Text_LilNotEnoughMons":"LIL: Huh? A battle?\\nI can't be bothered to do it alone.\\lBring two POKéMON, won't you?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontNeedAnyGrooming":"You don't need any grooming done?\\nOkay, we'll just have tea.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM26FromGiovanni":"{PLAYER} received TM26\\nfrom GIOVANNI.$","Text_MonUsedMove":"{STR_VAR_1} used {STR_VAR_2}!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadWhichTopic":"Which topic do you want to read?$","ViridianCity_Text_GoShoppingInPewterOccasionally":"I go shopping in PEWTER CITY\\noccasionally.\\pI have to take the winding trail in\\nVIRIDIAN FOREST when I go.$","PalletTown_Text_HmmIsThatRight":"Hmm…\\nIs that right…$","ViridianForest_Text_FriendsItchingToBattle":"I came here with some friends to\\ncatch us some BUG POKéMON!\\pThey're all itching to get into\\nsome POKéMON battles!$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldPostBattle":"I can't catch anything good.\\nNot one good POKéMON to be had!$","Route21_North_Text_WadeDefeat":"Heheh, MAGIKARP just don't make\\nthe grade, do they?$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FeelFreeToUsePC":"Please feel free to use that PC in\\nthe corner.\\pThe receptionist told me so.\\nIt's so kind of her!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SpaceShuttle":"Space Shuttle$","Route1_Text_WorkAtPokeMartTakeSample":"Hi!\\nI work at a POKéMON MART.\\pIt's part of a convenient chain\\nselling all sorts of items.\\pPlease, visit us in VIRIDIAN CITY.\\pI know, I'll give you a sample.\\nHere you go!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ExplainTownMap":"You can use the TOWN MAP to find\\nout where you are, or check the\\lnames of places.$","Text_DreamEaterDeclined":"…Snore…$","CableClub_Text_CantSingleBattleWithXPlayers":"The SINGLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$","CableClub_Text_UnionRoomAdapterNotConnected":"This is the POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB\\nUNION ROOM.\\pUnfortunately, your Wireless\\nAdapter is not connected properly.\\pPlease do come again.$","Route21_North_Text_WadePostBattle":"I seem to only catch MAGIKARP!$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeWhichCableClubService":"Welcome to the POKéMON CABLE\\nCLUB.\\pWhich of our services do you wish\\nto use?$","PalletTown_Text_OakLetMeSeePokedex":"OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nYou're back, are you?\\pHow much have you filled in your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pMay I see it?\\pLet's see…$","Text_DreamEaterWhichMon":"Which POKéMON wants to learn\\nDREAM EATER?$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeUnionRoomEnter":"Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB UNION ROOM.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nother TRAINERS here, some of\\lwhom you may not even know.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$","CableClub_Text_CantDoubleBattleWithXPlayers":"The DOUBLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$","Text_ProfileSaysSomethingAboutYou":"Hmhm…\\pYour profile really says something\\nabout who you are.\\pNow that I know you better, it \\nmakes us better friends than ever!$","Text_ImpressiveMachine":"It's a machine of some sort.\\nIt sure is impressive.$","PokedexRating_Text_YouveCompletedDex":"Finally…\\pYou've finally completed the\\nPOKéDEX!\\pIt's magnificent!\\nTruly, this is a fantastic feat!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiDefeat":"I ran out of gas!$","Route3_Text_JamesIntro":"I'll battle you with the POKéMON\\nI just caught.$","CableClub_Text_ExplainWirelessClub":"Let me explain how the POKéMON\\nWIRELESS CLUB works.\\pOn this, the top floor, there are\\ntwo rooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pSometimes, you may not be able to\\nfind your friends in the UNION ROOM\\lor the DIRECT CORNER.\\pIn that case, please move closer\\nto your friends.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeader":"Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","CableClub_Text_UnionRoomInfo":"The TRAINERS in the UNION ROOM\\nwill be those players around you\\lwho have also entered the ROOM.\\pYou may do all sorts of things\\nhere, such as exchanging greetings.\\pYou may enter two POKéMON up to\\nLv. 30 for a one-on-one battle.\\pYou may take part in a chat with\\ntwo to five people.\\pOr, you may register a POKéMON for\\ntrade.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$","Route21_North_Text_IanIntro":"IAN: My sis doesn't get enough\\nexercise, so I made her come.$","Text_FoundTMHMContainsMove":"{PLAYER} found a {STR_VAR_2}!\\nIt contains {STR_VAR_1}.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalMyMonLooksTougher":"{RIVAL}: My POKéMON looks a lot\\ntougher than yours.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakComeSeeMeSometime":"OAK: Come see me sometime.\\pAfter all, I want to know how your\\nPOKéDEX is coming along.$","Text_SeismicTossDeclined":"Is that so?\\nI'm sure you'll be back for it.$","PewterCity_Text_CallPoliceIfInfoOnThieves":"NOTICE!\\pThieves have been stealing POKéMON\\nfossils from MT. MOON.\\pPlease call the PEWTER POLICE if\\nyou have any information.$","Trade_Text_LookingForMonWannaTradeForMon":"I'm looking for the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pWanna trade one for my\\n{STR_VAR_2}?$","ViridianForest_Text_CantCatchOwnedMons":"TRAINER TIPS\\pYou can't catch a POKéMON that\\nbelongs to someone else.\\pThrow POKé BALLS only at wild\\nPOKéMON to catch them!$","Text_Cup":"It's a cup with a POKéMON mark\\non it.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonIntro":"POKéMON and I, we make wonderful\\nmusic together!$","Text_PolishedWindow":"The window is very well polished.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCanReachNextTownWithMon":"OAK: If a wild POKéMON appears,\\nyour POKéMON can battle it.\\pWith it at your side, you should be\\nable to reach the next town.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_ReceivedOaksParcelFromClerk":"{PLAYER} received OAK'S PARCEL\\nfrom the POKéMON MART clerk.$","CableClub_Text_TrainerCardDataOverwritten":"The TRAINER CARD data will\\nbe overwritten.$","ViridianCity_House_Text_NicknamingIsFun":"Coming up with nicknames is fun,\\nbut it's not so easy to do.\\pClever names are nice, but simple\\nnames are easier to remember.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalReceivedMonFromOak":"{RIVAL} received the {STR_VAR_1}\\nfrom PROF. OAK!$","ViridianCity_Text_HowsTeachyTVHelping":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pBut I made it too strong.\\nIt gave me a headache…\\pIncidentally, is my old TEACHY TV\\nhelping you?$","PokedexRating_Text_Wroooaaarrr":"Wroooooooaaaaaarrrr!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCompleteMonGuideWasMyDream":"To make a complete guide on all\\nthe POKéMON in the world…\\pThat was my dream!\\pBut, I'm too old.\\nI can't get the job done.\\pSo, I want you two to fulfill my\\ndream for me.\\pGet moving, you two.\\pThis is a great undertaking in\\nPOKéMON history!$","Text_MayIHelpYou":"Hi, there!\\nMay I help you?$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_ShopDoesGoodBusinessInAntidotes":"This shop does good business in\\nANTIDOTES, I've heard.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainBurn":"A burn reduces ATTACK power.\\nIt also causes ongoing HP loss.\\pA burn remains after a battle.\\nUse BURN HEAL to cure a burn.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiDefeat":"Ayah!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ReceivedTownMapFromDaisy":"{PLAYER} received a TOWN MAP\\nfrom DAISY.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNowTheseUnitsCanRecordMoreData":"… … …  … … …\\p… … …  … … …\\p…And that's done!\\pNow these units can record data on\\na lot more POKéMON.$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyPostBattle":"I lost some of my allowance…$","Route21_North_Text_IanNotEnoughMons":"IAN: We want a two-on-two battle.\\nSo can you bring two POKéMON?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiPostBattle":"The POKéMON LEAGUE?\\nYou? Don't get cocky!$","Route3_Text_RobinPostBattle":"ROUTE 4 is at the foot of\\nMT. MOON.$","ViridianCity_Text_ThisIsPrivateProperty":"I absolutely forbid you from\\ngoing through here!\\pThis is private property!$","ViridianForest_Text_CharlieDefeat":"Oh!\\nI lost!$"};
